        {
          "id": "S001",
          "text": "Fix arbitrary k0,n0,U0,T0,W0. Temporarily assume L1: n0>0, dim_{k0} U0=n0, T0_ij T0_kl=T0_il if j=k and 0 otherwise, ∑_j T0_jj=Id_{U0}, and W0 is invariant under all T0_ij. These are precisely the antecedent data of the asserted theorem.",
