        {
          "id": "S002",
          "text": "Use the exhaustive cases W0={0} or W0≠{0}. In the zero case L3: W0={0}, the required disjunction follows immediately; discharge L3 for that branch. In the remaining branch assume L2: W0≠{0}. By the definition of a zero subspace there exists a vector in W0 different from 0.",
