        },
        {
          "id": "S003",
          "text": "Choose w0∈W0 nonzero using F001. Apply the diagonal-sum identity in L1: w0=∑_j T0_jj(w0). If every summand were zero, w0 would be zero. Hence there exists j∈Fin(n0) with T0_jj(w0)≠0.",
