        {
          "id": "S004",
          "text": "Choose j0 from F002 and put u0=T0_j0,j0(w0). Stability gives u0∈W0; it is nonzero by choice. The relation T0_j0,j0^2=T0_j0,j0 gives T0_j0,j0(u0)=u0. Define uFamily_i=T0_i,j0(u0). Every uFamily_i belongs to W0 by stability.",
