          "text": "Take arbitrary coefficients acoef and assume L4: ∑_i acoef_i uFamily_i=0. Fix kidx∈Fin(n0) and apply T0_j0,kidx. The multiplication law from L1 kills every term except i=kidx, yielding 0=∑_i acoef_i T0_j0,kidx T0_i,j0(u0)=acoef_kidx T0_j0,j0(u0)=acoef_kidx u0. Since k0 is a field and u0≠0 by F003, acoef_kidx=0. This holds for every kidx. Discharge L4 to prove linear independence of uFamily.",
